  "title": "Garlic Shrimp Linguine",
  "description": "This shrimp linguine dish is a deceptively simple sauté of butter, garlic, white wine, Parmesan, and shrimp served over hot linguine with parsley.",
  "authors": [
    "STACEYO"
  ],
