  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound uncooked linguine",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "3 tablespoons white wine",
    "3 cloves garlic, minced",
    "2 teaspoons grated Parmesan cheese, plus more for serving",
    "1 teaspoon chopped fresh parsley, plus more for garnish",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "1 pound medium shrimp, peeled and deveined"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sA6URrZta8hgYVjd_JeNHxafIoM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-17048-garlic-shrimp-linguine-VAT-step-01-d1c83aaba9414ea18cc380324ceecb1f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17048/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook linguine at a boil until tender yet firm to the bite, about 11 minutes; drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/y6lNchOKKyJ6L99f03lQTKKZIgc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-17048-garlic-shrimp-linguine-VAT-step-02-1-9450c3d375c147409d1d9cce56c3ca01.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17048/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a medium saucepan over medium-low heat. Add white wine, garlic, Parmesan cheese, and parsley. Season to taste with salt and pepper. Simmer, stirring frequently, over low heat for 3 to 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5Ztac74jAs2kq3UbLKd7toqthRg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-17048-garlic-shrimp-linguine-VAT-step-03-1-0be3be4922ff4220bd3b6d1686d48f0c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17048/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increase heat to medium-high and add shrimp to the saucepan; cook until shrimp begins to turn pink, 3 to 4 minutes. Do not overcook.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e-rfJ-a77gQpMvwepT6HvX18YMo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-17048-garlic-shrimp-linguine-VAT-step-04-46992a27656549d8bc4bbcd204040629.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17048/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide pasta into 8 bowls. Spoon shrimp with sauce on top. Garnish with Parmesan cheese and parsley.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HElWcYRGhjz9tDGyvWx4RXhplYM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-17048-garlic-shrimp-linguine-VAT-step-05-591c507b75a348c7a2d2133bcb798ccd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17048/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
